## Resolved wizard choices

- Auth token store: `{{authStore}}` (refresh tokens and rate-limit backend)
- Browser topology: `{{authBrowserTopology}}` (cookie/CORS policy)
- Failed-login lockout: `{{authLockout}}` (account throttle policy)
- Worker queue: independent of auth storage; auth recovery/verification mail is
  sent inline even when River or Asynq is installed.

